{"id":"P067-1","subject":"P","unit":"P067","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P067-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n평행사변형의 대각선 벡터가 각각 ,\n일 때, 평행사변형의 변을 이루는\n\n두 개의 벡터는?\n\n\n① ,   \n② ,    \n③ ,    \n④ ,    ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":630},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1180}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n0.05F의 콘덴서에 20C의 전하가 축적되어 있을\n\n때, 콘덴서 양단의 전위차V는?\n\n\n① 300         ② 400\n\n③ 500         ④ 600","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":194}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n유전율이 Fm인 매질내에 한변의 길이가 m인\n\n정사각형 도체의 각 꼭지점에 C의 점전하가 있다.\n\n정사각형 도체 중심점에서의 전위kV는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0           ② 4\n\n③ 8           ④ 16","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":645}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n유전율이 각각 Fm, Fm인 두 매질의 경계면에\n\n수직으로 입사하는 전계와 관련한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것\n\n은?\n\n\n① 전계와 전속밀도는 굴절하지 않는다.\n\n② 전속밀도는 변하지 않는다.\n\n③ 전계는 연속이다.\n④ , 의 관계가 성립한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":572},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1210}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n자계의 세기가 ATm인 공간에 존재하는 어떤 물체\n에 작용하는 힘이 × N일 때, 이 물체의 자극의 세기\n\n는?\n\n\n① ×        ② × \n③ ×        ④ ×                                ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":399}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n한변의 길이가 1m인 정사각형 도체에 직류전류 4A가\n\n흐르고 있을 때, 정사각형 도체 중심점(점)의 자계의 세\n\n기Am는?\n\n\n\n\n\n   \n①             ②  \n   \n③             ④  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":701},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":722}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n자속밀도가 7.5m인 평등자계내에서 이와 수직된\n방향으로 길이가 10cm인 직선도체가 4ms의 속도로\n\n이동할 때, 직선도체에 유도되는 기전력V은?\n\n\n① 4.5          ② 3.0\n\n③ 2.5          ④ 1.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":762}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n환상 솔레노이드 내의 자속이 × 이고, 기자력\n은 1000AT 일 때, 자기저항AT은?\n\n\n\n① ×         ② × \n③ ×        ④ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":695},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":609}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n다중 중권 발전기의 극수가 4, 다중도가 2일 때, 병렬\n\n회로수()는?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 8           ④ 16","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":541},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1273}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n정격운전시 2.5kW, 100V, 25A 인 타여자 직류 발\n\n전기의 전기자 저항이 0.2Ω, 브러시에 의한 전압강하가\n\n2V일 때, 무부하시와 정격부하시의 단자전압 차이는 몇\n\nV인가?\n\n\n① 6           ② 7\n\n③ 8           ④ 9","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n동기 발전기의 전기자 반작용에 관한 내용으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 콘덴서 부하인 경우, 교차자화작용이 발생한다.\n\n② 리액터 부하인 경우, 횡축 반작용이 발생한다.\n\n③ 저항 부하인 경우, 직축 반작용이 발생한다.\n\n④ 전류가 전압보다 90° 앞서면 증자현상이 발생한다","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":927}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n다음의 곡선에서 단락비를 나타내는 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n                                   \n①           ② \n\n                                    \n③           ④                                     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e2