ric/2024h2-e26-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":703},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":996}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n분포정수 회로에서 선로정수가 , , , 이고, 무왜형\n\n조건이 성립할 때, 위상정수 는?\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":529},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":886}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P067-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n시간함수 의 라플라스 변환함수 는?\n\n\n                           \n①           ②                               \n\n                           \n③           ④                               ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.12.15 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e26-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":599},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e26-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":979}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"exp